PARSFILE
#FullDataName Procedures`Trough Wander`Driving
#CheckBox3 0    
#CheckBox4 0    

#RingCtrl0 1
#RingCtrl1 1
OPT_STOP 1
TSTART 0
SSTART -50
TSTART_WRITE = TSTART;
TSTOP 20
SSTOP 250
OPT_DIRECTION 0
*SPEED 60
*TSTOP 20
*TSTART 0
*SSTART -50
*SSTOP 250

INSTALL_DRIVER_SPEED_CONTROLLER CarSim9
OPT_SC 3
SPEED_TARGET_COMBINE ADD
SPEED_TARGET_CONSTANT 0
SPEED_TARGET_S_CONSTANT 60
OPT_SC_ENGINE_BRAKING 0
PARSFILE Control\Driver\StrDM_1c70a826-e18c-45eb-8db1-29790baf5799.par
#BlueLink27 Control: Steering by the Closed-loop Driver Model`1.65 m Right, 1.5 sec. Preview` Constant Position` , Steering`StrDM_1c70a826-e18c-45eb-8db1-29790baf5799

